<title>USA: Wintrust Financial Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Wintrust Financial Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE FOREST, Ill. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.10     loss	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net profit		   729     loss	   356</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,293		    5,862</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Full name of company is Wintrust Financial Corp.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 interest income $13.1 million vs $8.3 million for Q1 1996. Net interest income $5.3 million for Q1 1997 vs $3.1 million for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Provision for loan losses $679,000 for Q1 1997 vs $410,000 for Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets at March 31, 1997 were $765 million vs $520 million a year ago.</p>
